  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut beetroot into wedges.\n• Pick and finely chop rosemary (see ingredients).\n• Place beetroot and rosemary on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle over savoury seasoning and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 30-35 minutes.\n• TIP: Beetroot stays firm when cooked. It’s done when you can pierce it with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709715a5a49c635d8a865f/step-72435b00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut or tear bake-at-home ciabatta into bite-sized chunks.\n• When beetroot has 10 minutes remaining, place croutons on a second lined oven tray, drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat.\n• Spread out evenly and bake until golden, 5-7 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709715a5a49c635d8a865f/step-b6287b10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While croutons are baking, thinly slice pear into wedges.\n• Trim and halve green beans.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Thinly slice double cream Brie.\n• In a small microwave-safe bowl, microwave a good drizzle of oil with garlic and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using) until fragrant, 30 seconds. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709715a5a49c635d8a865f/step-44d3a620.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add green beans and a splash of water to a large microwave-safe bowl, then cover with damp paper towel.\n• Microwave green beans on high until just tender, 2-4 minutes.\n• Drain green beans, then return to the bowl and allow to cool slightly.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709715a5a49c635d8a865f/step-15709630.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the bowl with green beans, add spinach & rocket mix, pear, croutons, walnuts and balsamic vinaigrette dressing.\n• Toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709715a5a49c635d8a865f/step-0966ed40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide crouton salad between bowls. Top with warm beetroot and Brie.\n• Drizzle over garlic-chilli oil to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709715a5a49c635d8a865f/step-e4d3c150.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
